  "blocks": {
    "text-1": {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讲授视频由讲稿驱动：每一步的讲稿决定念什么、何时触发动作、在哪里停顿；配音可以来自 AI 合成、自己的录音，也可以静音，只放字幕。本教程依次练习这些操作，最后导出带字幕的视频。教程本身是静音的，打开时不调用语音服务；需要听声音的练习使用“冒泡排序”附带的配音。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "production-counter": {
      "id": "production-counter",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "action-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "label": "讲稿动作",
        "targetId": "production-action"
      }
    },
    "text-4": {
      "id": "text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本步的讲稿带有三种标记。读音标记让字幕显示“SQL”，配音读作“sequel”；动作标记在配音念到它时，让下方的计数器加一次；停顿标记让配音在该处停 240 毫秒。点击工具栏中的“字幕”，可以在讲稿栏中查看和编辑这些标记。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "timing-scene": {
      "id": "timing-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "timing-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "value": 25
      }
    },
    "text-6": {
      "id": "text-6",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-20",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "tn-21",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-22",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在“设置”的“语音服务”中填写服务密钥。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-23",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-24",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在“视频制作”中点击“选择音色”，选定音色及其应用范围：本步、本页或整份文稿。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-25",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-26",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点击“播放”：缺少的配音会自动生成并缓存，然后继续播放。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-27",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-28",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "要一次准备好全部配音，点击“生成配音”。讲稿改过的步骤会标记为需要更新。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-13": {
      "id": "text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-29",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "tn-30",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-31",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在“视频制作”的“原音频”卡中点击“开始录音”，并允许浏览器使用麦克风。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-32",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-33",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "录完后点击“停止录音”，试听后点击“保存为音频素材”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-34",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-35",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "选中这段录音，点击“采用为本步配音”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-16": {
      "id": "text-16",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "音频片段与讲稿的配音同时播放。在“音频片段”中导入本地音频，设置入点、出点、延后与音量，再点击“采用到本步”。片段只记录取用的时间范围，原文件保持不变。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-19": {
      "id": "text-19",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "配音或静音设置完成后，在“视频制作”中点击“导出”，选择“导出视频”，得到带字幕的讲授视频。视频里的声音、字幕与动作都来自每一步的讲稿：讲稿改过之后，重新生成配音再导出，视频随之更新。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "timing-instructions": {
      "id": "timing-instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第一步的讲稿与动画同时开始，第二步的讲稿等动画结束后才开始。在讲稿栏的“播放时机”中，可以在“同步动画”与“动画后”之间切换：讲解正在发生的变化时选同步动画，评论变化的结果时选动画后。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "timeline-practice": {
      "id": "timeline-practice",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-4",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "tn-5",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-6",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "打开“冒泡排序”，点击工具栏中的“视频制作”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-7",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-8",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "底部的时间线有画面、配音与字幕三条轨道，配音轨显示音频波形。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-9",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-10",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点击时间线上的某一步即可跳到那里，拖动播放头可以精确定位。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-11",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-12",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点击“播放”，再把“播放速度”设为 1.5 倍。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "silent-practice": {
      "id": "silent-practice",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-13",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "tn-14",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-15",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "新建一份文稿，在任一页面的讲稿中输入一句话。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-16",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-17",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "进入“视频制作”，点击“选择音色”，把“声音来源”设为“静音”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tn-18",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "tn-19",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "把最短停留设为 2000 毫秒，点击“播放”：字幕按时推进，没有声音。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "recording-more": {
      "id": "recording-more",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "tn-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "也可以导入已有的音频。配置转写服务后，录音可以转写成文字，点击“采用讲稿”把它用作本步的讲稿，之后还可以改用 AI 配音。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "g-script-intro": {
      "id": "g-script-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "g-script-intro-p",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讲稿除了文字，还可以带三种标记：读音、动作与停顿。每一步还要决定讲稿与动画同时开始，还是等动画结束再开始。接下来两页分别练习。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "g-preview-intro": {
      "id": "g-preview-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "g-preview-intro-p",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "导出之前，先在时间线上预览整份讲授：画面、配音与字幕按步骤排在一起。还没有配音时，可以先做一份静音讲授，只让字幕按时推进。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "g-voice-intro": {
      "id": "g-voice-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "g-voice-intro-p",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讲授的声音有三种来源：AI 合成的配音、自己的录音，以及与配音同时播放的音频片段。接下来三页分别练习。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "start-keys": {
      "id": "start-keys",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "start-key-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讲稿 → 配音（AI · 录音 · 静音）→ 带字幕的视频"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "start-key-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本教程静音，不调用语音服务"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
